        <div class="card-body pt-3">
          <div class="h4">What is the capital and currency of Japan?</div>
          <div class="date text-secondary">
            Updated: 11-Apr-2025          </div>
          <div class="short-ans mt-3"><p style="text-align: justify;">The capital of Japan is Tokyo, a vibrant metropolis blending tradition and modernity. Its official currency is the Japanese Yen (JPY), symbolized as &yen;. Tokyo is one of the world&rsquo;s largest cities and a major financial hub.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The Yen is among the most traded currencies globally, playing a vital role in international finance and trade. Japan&rsquo;s efficient economy and strong export market make its capital and currency highly significant on the world stage</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

